  "evidenceSpans": [
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-b1d4263c",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法适用于本行办理的**跨境人民币结算、跨境人民币融资及与之相关的账户与资金划转**业务。",
      "quoteHash": "b1d4263c079399d4f6d7bf1d126c4d81a862305f6685597f32e44cd59a3e0ee4",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-93386011",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "办理本业务应贯彻**展业三原则**（了解客户、了解业务、尽职审查），并落实\"**交易可核验、资金可追溯、报送可复算**\"三项行内要求。",
      "quoteHash": "93386011f945c0b3dfa16b4c8d42d71c8a5dcce295d7aba44cd6213449723788",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-3d83126e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "申请办理跨境人民币业务的客户应同时满足：一、依法登记并在本行开立账户；二、内部评级不低于本行跨境业务准入线（见 `SRC-XFAM-001`）；三、具有真实、合法的跨境交易背景（核验按 `SRC-TF-003`）；四、不属于本行名单类管控对象。",
      "quoteHash": "3d83126eb51c4afa04e95c764aec695b9566d9dd61558194ccc01febdd3133ff",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-4df82a6e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0008",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "对**新增客户、大额交易、交易对手所在地区属高风险**的业务，应作为重点样本启动**加强尽调**并留存尽调记录。",
      "quoteHash": "4df82a6e6479dafccabe78963ecf68c2eea64b7c20b0eb0e81a5ed5c8bad2c6f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-8ec724a7",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0010",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "审核环节应形成书面审核意见，至少包括：交易背景核查结论、资金用途判断、限制类情形排查结论、以及**法定报送要求是否已落实**（报送口径以 `REG-CB-001` 为准，本件不规定）。",
      "quoteHash": "8ec724a7cabb9b38ca78a930084b6dcbb2bca701c04ce67a338c07fa6c2d09e3",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-b5424c92",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0011",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "跨境人民币资金划转应通过**指定账户**办理；账户使用范围与资金划转的**法定规则以 `REG-CB-001` 为准**。",
      "quoteHash": "b5424c92d8643850dfade01d7cf122a8a15717ac977a0639c86b7646ab949efb",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-49671b1f",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "业务办理应在行内系统全程留痕，关键节点（受理、审核、放款/划转、复核）应可回溯；不得以线下手工方式替代系统登记。",
      "quoteHash": "49671b1ff850559ce747378ddfd4e78bb2a8aaa2c258e90be19c3286d15a7c8f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-b6cf079b",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0013",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "涉及跨境担保、保函等增信安排的，**依法应当办理的登记或备案手续以 `REG-CB-002` 及相关规定为准**，本件不另行规定。",
      "quoteHash": "b6cf079ba9d9683de25206f6dd5927ecac1ce516668fbd38e64e13bd68565e48",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-fd8ed2e5",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0016",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "发现异常的，应暂停后续办理并查明原因；涉嫌可疑交易的，按本行可疑交易报告相关规定处理。",
      "quoteHash": "fd8ed2e5a3082b65b340abdd416e5641c3cb7a9d968c0c88c5f9310f539ab46d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "75a3b60228ab7e815590381d49f71ece4e0862a51406941b9a78e7f62e586ead",
      "sourceId": "SRC-CB-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-CB-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCCB001-20260922-75a3b602",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCCB001-7823b944",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCCB001-0017",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "对**虚假交易背景、构造交易或以跨境渠道套利**的情形，按本行风险处置流程处理，并追究相关人员责任。",
      "quoteHash": "7823b9441435d5e2aa623f15066d6b9d69265baeb9274260133ed8a2b7173c3c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
